            "description": {
              "content": "| Property                              | Description                                                                   | Required |\r\n| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- |\r\n| JobGuid                               | The JobGuid associated to the about to be deleted job.| Yes |\r\n| DeleteReasonGuid                  | Delete Reason GUID IDthat match to the job                       | Yes |\r\n\r\n**Extra validations**\r\n\r\n| Condition | Error message |\r\n| --------- | ------------- |\r\n| JobGuid is null | JobGuid is required. |\r\n| DeleteReasonGuid is null | DeleteReasonGuid is required. |\r\n| DeleteReasonGuid does not apply to the job | The supplied Delete Reason does not apply to the job type of the job being deleted. |\r\n| DeleteReasonGuid cannot be found | This Delete Reason cannot be found. |\r\n| Job GUID cannot be found | This job cannot be found. |\r\n| Job is already allocated | The job must be unallocated before it can be deleted. |\r\n| Job GUID is not a scheduled job | This job type cannot be deleted. |\r\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
